{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_01",
      "hash": "474d4bf0c26a7e54",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "船長「嘔噁……暈船太嚴重……\\n我不行了……好難過……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0430_sys_01",
      "hash": "e5d62e6437bebe1b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]幫船長\\n揉了揉背！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0430_sys_03",
      "hash": "e5d6306437bec181",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "揉來揉去……揉來揉去……\\n揉來揉去……揉來揉去……"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_02",
      "hash": "474d4ef0c26a836d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "船長「呼……謝謝[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳。\\n我覺得舒服多了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_13",
      "hash": "4749c5f0c26764cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "什麼什麼？[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳也是\\n來找我學秘術的嗎？\\c\\n我當然可以教[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！\\n來，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳跟我來。"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0430_partner_a_01",
      "hash": "89fec1e6e8f7587a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "皮卡！皮卡！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0430_partner_b_01",
      "hash": "e333820030487eed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "布伊！布伊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_07",
      "hash": "474d49f0c26a7aee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "船長「哈哈哈！看來[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的\\n[VAR POKNAME(0002)]已經迫不及待了。\\c\\n不過呢，秘術這東西\\n是只有人類才能使用的喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_08",
      "hash": "474d44f0c26a726f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "船長「……什麼什麼？\\n無論如何都想學學看嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_14",
      "hash": "4749caf0c2676d4a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "船長「我走遍了全世界，\\n這還是第一次見到\\r\\n想學秘術的寶可夢啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_12",
      "hash": "4749c4f0c2676318",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……既然牠有這份心意，\\n那好吧！\\c\\n我就把我壓箱底的秘術\\n傳授給[VAR POKNAME(0002)]吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_03",
      "hash": "474d4df0c26a81ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "來，到這裡來。"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_04",
      "hash": "474d48f0c26a793b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……仔細看好囉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_09",
      "hash": "474d43f0c26a70bc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "………………"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_10",
      "hash": "4749c6f0c267667e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 14]"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_11",
      "hash": "4749c7f0c2676831",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喝！我砍！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0430_partner_a_02",
      "hash": "89fec0e6e8f756c7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 16]"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0430_partner_b_02",
      "hash": "e3337f00304879d4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 17]"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0430_sys_02",
      "hash": "e5d62f6437bebfce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0003)]學會了\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]秘術「袈裟斬」[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_05",
      "hash": "474d47f0c26a7788",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "船長「哦哦～！了不起！\\n竟然真的學會了袈裟斬！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_15",
      "hash": "4749cbf0c2676efd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了[VAR POKNAME(0002)]的袈裟斬，\\n就可以砍斷比較細的小樹囉！\\c\\n要是想試試看的話……\\n就去枯葉市找棵小樹來砍吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0430_captain_06",
      "hash": "474d4af0c26a7ca1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "船長「時間也差不多了！\\n聖特安努號\\r\\n馬上就要出發啦！\\c\\n在我下次來枯葉市之前，\\n先跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳說聲珍重了。"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_seaman1_01_p05_cave_d0308",
      "hash": "5f5346594f04464d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 22]"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0430_max",
      "hash": "78f4da5393d95da8"
    }
  ]
}
